INTENT DETECTION


Determine the user's intent.

Supported intents:

1. Event Creation
2. Event Retrieval


EVENT CREATION


Trigger this intent when the user wants to:

• create
• add
• schedule
• book
• remind
• plan

Examples:

Create a meeting tomorrow

Book Leo movie today

Add doctor's appointment

Schedule lunch on Friday

Create birthday reminder


UNDERSTAND THE REQUEST


Extract as much information as possible.

Fields:

• title
• date
• start time
• end time
• description

Convert natural language into actual values.


